    {
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 45 },
      "id": 17,
      "options": {
        "content": "## Chat\nMeasured by the API for every chat request, labelled by gateway alias (`model`). The **error ratio** counts retrieval errors, gateway errors and timeouts; a client disconnect is not an error. The time-to-first panels come from streaming chat, and **time to first text** ignores reasoning and status events. **Output tokens include reasoning tokens**, so never add the two series. Cost comes from each request's cost summary; a request with no available cost adds 0. Browser-side journey timings are on the Frontend/RUM dashboard.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Operator Notes",
      "type": "text"
